#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:1
msgid "Git API"
msgstr "Git API"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:3
msgid "Git repository helpers are available under `ptool.git` and `p.git`."
msgstr "Git 仓库辅助能力位于 `ptool.git` 和 `p.git` 下。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:5
msgid "This module is backed by `git2` / `libgit2`, not by invoking the `git` command-line tool."
msgstr "这个模块基于 `git2` / `libgit2`，而不是通过调用 `git` 命令行工具实现。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:8
msgid "Mutating operations accept `confirm = true` in their options table to ask the user for confirmation before the action runs. Destructive operations also use separate safety flags such as `force = true`; confirmation never replaces the required safety flag."
msgstr "修改仓库的操作可在选项表中传入 `confirm = true`，以便在执行前请求用户确认。破坏性操作还会使用独立的安全标志，例如 `force = true`；确认操作不能替代必需的安全标志。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:13
msgid "Unknown option names are rejected instead of being silently ignored."
msgstr "未知选项名会直接报错，而不会被静默忽略。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:15
msgid "ptool.git.init"
msgstr "ptool.git.init"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:17
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:17"
msgid "`Unreleased` - Introduced."
msgstr "`Unreleased` - 引入。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:19
msgid "`ptool.git.init(path?, options?)` initializes a repository and returns a `Repo` object."
msgstr "`ptool.git.init(path?, options?)` 初始化仓库并返回一个 `Repo` 对象。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:22
msgid "Options:"
msgstr "选项："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:24
msgid "`bare` (boolean): Create a bare repository. Defaults to `false`."
msgstr "`bare`（boolean）：创建 bare 仓库。默认为 `false`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:25
msgid "`initial_head` (string): Initial branch name, for example `\"main\"`."
msgstr "`initial_head`（string）：初始分支名，例如 `\"main\"`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:26
msgid "`confirm` (boolean): Ask before creating the repository."
msgstr "`confirm`（boolean）：创建仓库前请求确认。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:28
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:28"
msgid "Relative paths are resolved from the current `ptool` runtime directory."
msgstr "相对路径会从当前 `ptool` 运行时目录解析。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:36
msgid "ptool.git.open"
msgstr "ptool.git.open"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:38
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:38"
msgid "`v0.6.0` - Introduced."
msgstr "`v0.6.0` - 引入。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:40
msgid "`ptool.git.open(path?)` opens a repository directly and returns a `Repo` object."
msgstr "`ptool.git.open(path?)` 直接打开一个仓库，并返回 `Repo` 对象。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:43
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:43"
msgid "Arguments:"
msgstr "参数："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:45
msgid "`path` (string, optional): Repository path. If omitted, the current `ptool` runtime directory is used."
msgstr "`path`（string，可选）：仓库路径。省略时使用当前 `ptool` 运行时目录。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:48
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:48"
msgid "Behavior:"
msgstr "行为说明："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:50
msgid "Relative paths are resolved from the current `ptool` runtime directory, so they follow `ptool.cd(...)`."
msgstr "相对路径会从当前 `ptool` 运行时目录解析，因此会跟随 `ptool.cd(...)`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:52
msgid "This does not search parent directories. Use `ptool.git.discover(...)` when you want repository discovery behavior."
msgstr "这个 API 不会向父目录继续搜索仓库。如果你需要仓库发现行为，请使用 `ptool.git.discover(...)`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:55
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:55"
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:62
msgid "ptool.git.discover"
msgstr "ptool.git.discover"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:64
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:64"
msgid "`v0.6.0` - Introduced."
msgstr "`v0.6.0` - 引入。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:66
msgid "`ptool.git.discover(path?)` finds a repository starting from `path` and walking up parent directories, then returns a `Repo` object."
msgstr "`ptool.git.discover(path?)` 从 `path` 开始向上遍历父目录查找仓库，然后返回一个 `Repo` 对象。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:69
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:69"
msgid "Arguments:"
msgstr "参数："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:71
msgid "`path` (string, optional): Starting path. If omitted, the current `ptool` runtime directory is used."
msgstr "`path`（string，可选）：起始路径。省略时使用当前 `ptool` 运行时目录。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:74
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:74"
msgid "Behavior:"
msgstr "行为说明："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:76
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:76"
msgid "Relative paths are resolved from the current `ptool` runtime directory."
msgstr "相对路径会从当前 `ptool` 运行时目录解析。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:77
msgid "This is useful when a script may run from a subdirectory inside a worktree."
msgstr "当脚本可能在 worktree 的某个子目录中运行时，这个 API 很有用。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:79
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:79"
