msgstr "示例："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:86
msgid "ptool.git.clone"
msgstr "ptool.git.clone"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:88
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:88"
msgid "`v0.6.0` - Introduced."
msgstr "`v0.6.0` - 引入。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:90
msgid "`ptool.git.clone(url, path[, options])` clones a repository and returns a `Repo` object for the cloned repository."
msgstr "`ptool.git.clone(url, path[, options])` 克隆一个仓库，并返回该克隆仓库对应的 `Repo` 对象。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:93
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:93"
msgid "Arguments:"
msgstr "参数："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:95
msgid "`url` (string, required): Remote repository URL."
msgstr "`url`（string，必填）：远端仓库 URL。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:96
msgid "`path` (string, required): Destination path."
msgstr "`path`（string，必填）：目标路径。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:97
msgid "`options` (table, optional): Clone options. Supported fields:"
msgstr "`options`（table，可选）：克隆选项。支持的字段："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:97
msgid "`branch` (string, optional): Branch name to check out after cloning."
msgstr "`branch`（string，可选）：克隆完成后要检出的分支名。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:97
msgid "`bare` (boolean, optional): Whether to create a bare repository. Defaults to `false`."
msgstr "`bare`（boolean，可选）：是否创建裸仓库。默认值为 `false`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:97
msgid "`depth` (integer, optional): Positive shallow-clone depth."
msgstr "`depth`（integer，可选）：浅克隆的正整数深度。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:97
msgid "`checkout` (boolean, optional): Whether to check out the selected branch. Defaults to `true`."
msgstr "`checkout`（boolean，可选）：是否检出所选分支。默认为 `true`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:97
msgid "`remote` (string, optional): Name assigned to the cloned remote. Defaults to `\"origin\"`."
msgstr "`remote`（string，可选）：分配给克隆远端的名称。默认为 `\"origin\"`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:97
msgid "`tags` (string, optional): `\"auto\"`, `\"all\"`, or `\"none\"`. Defaults to `\"auto\"`."
msgstr "`tags`（string，可选）：`\"auto\"`、`\"all\"` 或 `\"none\"`。默认为 `\"auto\"`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:97
msgid "`confirm` (boolean, optional): Whether to ask for confirmation before cloning. Defaults to `false`."
msgstr "`confirm`（boolean，可选）：克隆前是否请求确认。默认值为 `false`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:97
msgid "`auth` (table, optional): Remote authentication settings."
msgstr "`auth`（table，可选）：远端认证设置。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:112
msgid "`auth` fields:"
msgstr "`auth` 字段："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:114
msgid "`kind` (string, required): Authentication mode. Supported values:"
msgstr "`kind`（string，必填）：认证模式。支持的值："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:114
msgid "`\"default\"`: Use libgit2 default credentials."
msgstr "`\"default\"`: 使用 libgit2 的默认凭据。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:114
msgid "`\"ssh_agent\"`: Authenticate through the local SSH agent."
msgstr "`\"ssh_agent\"`: 通过本地 SSH agent 进行认证。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:114
msgid "`\"ssh_key\"`: Authenticate with an SSH private key."
msgstr "`\"ssh_key\"`：使用 SSH 私钥进行认证。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:114
msgid "`\"userpass\"`: Use a plaintext username and password."
msgstr "`\"userpass\"`: 使用明文用户名和密码。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:114
msgid "`\"credential_helper\"`: Ask the configured Git credential helper."
msgstr "`\"credential_helper\"`：查询已配置的 Git 凭据助手。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:120
msgid "`username` (string): Optional for `\"ssh_agent\"` and `\"credential_helper\"`; required for `\"ssh_key\"` and `\"userpass\"`."
msgstr "`username`（string）：对 `\"ssh_agent\"` 和 `\"credential_helper\"` 可选；对 `\"ssh_key\"` 和 `\"userpass\"` 必填。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:122
msgid "`private_key` (string, required for `\"ssh_key\"`): Private key path. Relative paths are resolved from the current `ptool` runtime directory."
msgstr "`private_key`（string，`\"ssh_key\"` 必填）：私钥路径。相对路径从当前 `ptool` 运行时目录解析。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:124
msgid "`public_key` (string, optional): Public key path."
msgstr "`public_key`（string，可选）：公钥路径。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:125
msgid "`passphrase` (string, optional): SSH private-key passphrase."
msgstr "`passphrase`（string，可选）：SSH 私钥口令。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:126
msgid "`password` (string, required for `\"userpass\"`): Password."
msgstr "`password`（string，`\"userpass\"` 必填）：密码。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:128
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:128"
msgid "Behavior:"
msgstr "行为说明："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:130
msgid "Relative destination paths are resolved from the current `ptool` runtime directory."
msgstr "相对目标路径会从当前 `ptool` 运行时目录解析。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:132
msgid "Authentication options are also used by `repo:fetch(...)` and `repo:push(...)`."
msgstr "认证选项同样会被 `repo:fetch(...)` 和 `repo:push(...)` 使用。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:135
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:135"
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:152
msgid "Repo"
msgstr "Repo"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:154
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:154"
msgid "`v0.6.0` - Introduced."
msgstr "`v0.6.0` - 引入。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:156
msgid "`Repo` represents an open Git repository handle returned by `ptool.git.init()`, `ptool.git.open()`, `ptool.git.discover()`, or `ptool.git.clone()`."
msgstr "`Repo` 表示由 `ptool.git.init()`、`ptool.git.open()`、`ptool.git.discover()` 或 `ptool.git.clone()` 返回的已打开 Git 仓库句柄。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:159
msgid "It is implemented as a Lua userdata."
msgstr "它实现为 Lua userdata。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:161
msgid "Methods are grouped below. Existing repository, status, staging, commit, checkout, switch, fetch, and push methods remain backward compatible. The workflow APIs described in the following sections are currently unreleased."
msgstr ""
"以下按组介绍各方法。已有的仓库、状态、暂存、提交、checkout、switch、fetch 和 "
"push 方法保持向后兼容。后续章节描述的工作流 API 当前尚未发布。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:165
msgid "path"
msgstr "path"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:167
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:167"
msgid "`v0.6.0` - Introduced."
msgstr "`v0.6.0` - 引入。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:169
msgid "Canonical API name: `ptool.git.Repo:path`."
msgstr "规范 API 名称：`ptool.git.Repo:path`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:171
msgid "`repo:path()` returns the repository git directory path."
msgstr "`repo:path()` 返回仓库的 Git 目录路径。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:173
msgid "Returns: `string`."
msgstr "返回：`string`。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:175
msgctxt "/Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:175"
msgid "Notes:"
msgstr "说明："

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:177
msgid "For a non-bare repository this is typically the `.git` directory."
msgstr "对于非裸仓库，这通常是 `.git` 目录。"

#: /Users/peterlits/Proj/PeterlitsZo/worktrees/ptool/full-lantern/ptool/website/docs/lua-api/git.md:178
